              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Shannon Benson Rockwell"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was so good. I don’t like raw garlic added into dishes I think it throws the texture off so I cooked the garlic in a tablespoon of oil until lightly browned before adding it to the potatoes.",
