            "reviewBody": "I followed the recipe without changing a thing except making them into individual muffins. I had two problems. First, the cake batter was incredibly thick and had to be thinned out a bit. The other issue was the salt. Next time I would use half the salt listed and unsalted butter. I was happy with how the topping turned out and only having to cook them an extra 5 minutes.",
