            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "rbrogan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Since other reviewers commented on the cheesiness, I reduced the parmesan by half, and used sour cream and milk instead. I heated the combined mixture in a saucepan, based on recommendations. While the result was tasty, it was also very rich and so it cannot be eaten in large heapings. Also, I took the butter and garlic, used it to sautee onions, and mixed the drippings into the potatoes, and then served the onions on the side. Overall, it came out pretty well.",
            "datePublished": "2015-11-27T10:53:09.850Z"
